{"id":"west-africa-overland","title":"West Africa overland: Morocco to Ghana","who":"Classic overland route","when":"Best November–March (dry season)","vehicle":"Motorcycle, 4x4 or overland truck, 2–3 months","kind":"4x4","color":"#c2410c","summary":"The great West African coast run: down through Morocco and the Western Sahara, the iron-ore train country of Mauritania, Senegal, then the green coast through the Gambia, Guinea-Bissau, Guinea, Sierra Leone, Liberia and Côte d'Ivoire to Accra. The old inland route via Mali and Burkina Faso is today avoided for security reasons; check current advice and visas before going.","sources":[{"label":"Local Adventures: Fes to Ghana overland (81 days)","url":"https://localadventures.travel/tours/fes-morocco-to-ghana-group-overland-tour-qbisemz"},{"label":"Horizons Unlimited: Ghana to Morocco solo by motorcycle","url":"https://www.horizonsunlimited.com/hubb/route-planning/ghana-to-morocco-moto-solo-88081?nojs=1"},{"label":"Horizons Unlimited: West Africa route thread","url":"https://horizonsunlimited.com/hubb/sub-saharan-africa/west-africa-103429"}],"approximate":"Usual corridor from overland tours and rider reports; roads approximate.","km":7332,"bbox":[-17.4476,4.89,-0.2012,35.7694],"stops":[{"name":"Tangier","place":"Tangier, Morocco","at":[35.7695,-5.8045],"text":"Ferry from Spain into Africa.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Tanger_cor.jpg/500px-Tanger_cor.jpg","page":"Tangier","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tanger_cor.jpg","credit":"Ifni95","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Marrakech","place":"Marrakech, Morocco","at":[31.6258,-7.9892],"text":"Over the Atlas.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Marrakech%2C_Morocco_%285421595453%29_%285%29.jpg/500px-Marrakech%2C_Morocco_%285421595453%29_%285%29.jpg","page":"Marrakesh","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Marrakech%2C_Morocco_%285421595453%29_%285%29.jpg","credi